Gaussian Scene Workbench License Notice
==========================

Language / 语言 / 言語: [English](#english) | [中文](#中文) | [日本語](#日本語)

Important: The English license text is the authoritative version. The Chinese
and Japanese sections are non-authoritative translations and explanations for
reader convenience.

English
-------

This repository contains original Gaussian Scene Workbench code and bundled third-party
components under several licenses. Research, learning and evaluation describe
the project's intended use, not an additional restriction on its GPL or MIT code.

Native Desktop Main Program: GPL-3.0-or-later
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

From the licensing change dated 2026-10-14, the original native desktop main
program is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or (at
your option) any later version. See native/LICENSE.md for the precise scope
and COPYING for the complete GPL version 3 text.

This scope covers the original native/src, native/tests and native/i18n files,
native/CMakeLists.txt, and original native build resources, except material
with its own license notice. Third-party files and the separate native/worker
compute components retain their applicable existing licenses. The Blender
geometry adaptation retains its GPL-2.0-or-later upstream notices and is
combined with the desktop main program under GPL version 3 or later.

Earlier MIT grants are not revoked. Code outside the scope above remains
under the following MIT terms unless a file or directory states otherwise.

